flowchart LR
    pr[Pull request] --> ci{GitHub Actions}
    ci --> bt[Backend: gradlew check<br/>unit + Testcontainers]
    ci --> ft[Frontend: lint, test,<br/>i18n key check, SSR build]
    ci --> e2e[Playwright: PL and EN<br/>smoke tests]
    main[Merge to main] --> img[Build images<br/>api + web]
    img --> ghcr[(GHCR)]
    ghcr --> deploy[SSH to VPS:<br/>compose pull and up -d]
    deploy --> smoke[Health check<br/>/ and /en]
